@startuml autonomous-capability-enterprise-boundary
title Autonomous Capability vs Autonomous Enterprise Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Capability" as acap
class "Autonomous Enterprise" as aent

note left of acap
  Capability-level autonomy
end note

note right of aent
  Enterprise-level autonomy
  per ADR-ES-011
end note

note bottom
  Distinct semantic kinds
  per ADR-ES-013 §12
  per ACAP-AUTO-NEG-006
  A single Autonomous Capability
  does NOT establish
  Autonomous Enterprise
end note
@enduml
